  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* 解决扫码登录后Cookie转义问题 by @nilaoda in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/890\r\n* fix tv parser by @My-Responsitories in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/907\r\n* Feature: 支持交互/互动视频下载 by @LyceumHewun in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/913\r\n* 优化课程和番剧 EP/SS ID 解析，提升用户体验 by @lc6464 in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/919\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @LyceumHewun made their first contribution in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/913\r\n* @lc6464 made their first contribution in https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/pull/919\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/nilaoda/BBDown/compare/1.6.2...1.6.3\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n`1.6.3`版本仅同步最新`master`代码, 非预期的大版本更新.",
